Ethervolt supplies electricity to much of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. It has lately been spending capital in ways that do not fit it, with a spike in recent weeks. [[Org/Belvedere|Belvedere]] has named it to [[People/Benny|Benny]] as one of two companies worth looking into, the other being [[Org/Alkahest Freight/index|Alkahest Freight]].
